  "intro": ["The town of Haino has an underground that is on no map.", "Beneath the closed public library, and deeper still.", "Every year, the stacks sink a little deeper.", "Long ago, your little sister vanished down there and never came back.", "No one in town remembers her name anymore.", "Only you remember. Or so you thought.", {"text": "Your body remembers how cold the water was.", "meta": "m_dead_f4"}, {"text": "The backs of your eyelids remember green letters, blinking.", "meta": "m_dead_f5"}, {"text": "> Lending card issued. Name: ■■", "nometa": "m_dead_any"}, {"text": "> Lending card reissued. Name: ■■", "meta": "m_dead_any", "nometa": "cleared_normal"}, {"text": "> Rereading begins. Name: ■■", "meta": "cleared_normal"}],
